rt of a team of up to four reprobates. Complete missions to upgrade your equipment and customize your base, van, and outfit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729700/extras/19c76283ca276cfe76ce4b2cf67710df.avif?t=1787315207\" width=780 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729700/extras/aa4542d477356c42c03213bc2a77b98e.poster.avif?t=1787315207\" width=780 height=275 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729700/extras/aa4542d477356c42c03213bc2a77b98e.webm?t=1787315207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore environments the Kaiju have rudely died in and figure out what they have against skyscrapers anyway. Pick apart audio logs, chat with your crew, leaf through an evolving codex of Kaiju research, and enjoy rigorous fact-checking with InfoBlast, a legally-recognised news programme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729700/extras/510a5fd8f741f7689121f63c70296f5e.poster.avif?t=1787315207\" width=780 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729700/extras/510a5fd8f741f7689121f63c70296f5e.webm?t=1787315207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>We think you'll love Kaiju Cleanup if you enjoy...</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Crime Scene Cleaner, Satisfac